# Keep build context small and secrets out of images.
# (Relative to the repo root, which is the build context.)

# Virtual environments (huge, host-specific)
**/venv/
**/.venv/

# Python caches
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/

# Secrets — never bake into an image
**/.env
*.env
!**/.env.example

# Generated vector store (rebuilt from PDFs; a PVC holds it in K3s)
**/chroma_data/

# Local working docs (also gitignored)
CONSTITUTION.md
TRACKER.md

# Git + OS noise
.git/
.github/
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
